      <h2>Two and a half minutes, several hundred times a day.</h2>
      <p>
        A ward does not lose an hour at a time. It loses two or three minutes per call — walking
        back for equipment, finding a qualified colleague, checking a call that turned out to be
        nothing — and it does that around eight times per patient per day.
      </p>
      <p>
        Put your own bed count and your own cost assumptions in, and the calculator shows what that
        adds up to over a year. It runs entirely in your browser: no sign-up, no email required, and
        nothing is sent to us.
      </p>
      <div class="button-row" style="margin-top: 1.75rem">
        <a class="button" href="/en/savings-calculator/">Open the savings calculator</a>
      </div>
    </div>

